{"id":"torrey:prayer-answers-to","source":"torrey","name":"Prayer, Answers To","slug":"prayer-answers-to","seeAlso":[],"entries":[{"text":"God gives — Ps 99:6; 118:5; 138:3.","refs":[["Ps",99,6,99,6],["Ps",118,5,118,5],["Ps",138,3,138,3]]},{"text":"Christ gives — Joh 4:10,14; 14:14.","refs":[["John",4,10,4,10],["John",4,14,4,14],["John",14,14,14,14]]},{"text":"Christ received — Joh 11:42; Heb 5:7.","refs":[["John",11,42,11,42],["Heb",5,7,5,7]]},{"text":"Through the grace of God. — Isa 30:19.","refs":[["Isa",30,19,30,19]]},{"text":"Sometimes immediately. — Isa 65:24; Da 9:21,23; 10:12.","refs":[["Isa",65,24,65,24],["Dan",9,21,9,21],["Dan",9,23,9,23],["Dan",10,12,10,12]]},{"text":"Sometimes after delay. — Lu 18:7.","refs":[["Luke",18,7,18,7]]},{"text":"Sometimes differently from our desire. — 2Co 12:8,9.","refs":[["2Cor",12,8,12,8],["2Cor",12,9,12,9]]},{"text":"Beyond expectation. — Jer 33:3; Eph 3:20.","refs":[["Jer",33,3,33,3],["Eph",3,20,3,20]]},{"text":"Promised — Isa 58:9; Jer 29:12; Mt 7:7.","refs":[["Isa",58,9,58,9],["Jer",29,12,29,12],["Matt",7,7,7,7]]},{"text":"Promised especially in times of trouble — Ps 50:15; 91:15.","refs":[["Ps",50,15,50,15],["Ps",91,15,91,15]]},{"text":"Seek God. — Ps 34:4.","refs":[["Ps",34,4,34,4]]},{"text":"Seek God with all the heart. — Jer 29:12,13.","refs":[["Jer",29,12,29,12],["Jer",29,13,29,13]]},{"text":"Wait upon God. — Ps 40:1.","refs":[["Ps",40,1,40,1]]},{"text":"Return to God. — 2Ch 7:14; Job 22:23,27.","refs":[["2Chr",7,14,7,14],["Job",22,23,22,23],["Job",22,27,22,27]]},{"text":"Ask in faith. — Mt 21:11; Jas 5:15.","refs":[["Matt",21,11,21,11],["Jas",5,15,5,15]]},{"text":"Ask in the name of Christ. — Joh 14:13.","refs":[["John",14,13,14,13]]},{"text":"Ask according to God’s will. — 1Jo 5:14.","refs":[["1John",5,14,5,14]]},{"text":"Call upon God in truth. — Ps 145:18.","refs":[["Ps",145,18,145,18]]},{"text":"Fear God. — Ps 145:19.","refs":[["Ps",145,19,145,19]]},{"text":"Set their love upon God. — Ps 91:14,15.","refs":[["Ps",91,14,91,14],["Ps",91,15,91,15]]},{"text":"Keep God’s commandments. — 1Jo 3:22.","refs":[["1John",3,22,3,22]]},{"text":"Call upon God under oppression. — Isa 19:20.","refs":[["Isa",19,20,19,20]]},{"text":"Call upon God under affliction. — Ps 18:6; 106:44; Isa 30:19,20.","refs":[["Ps",18,6,18,6],["Ps",106,44,106,44],["Isa",30,19,30,19],["Isa",30,20,30,20]]},{"text":"Abide in Christ. — Joh 15:7.","refs":[["John",15,7,15,7]]},{"text":"Humble themselves. — 2Ch 7:14; Ps 9:12.","refs":[["2Chr",7,14,7,14],["Ps",9,12,9,12]]},{"text":"Are righteous. — Ps 34:15; Jas 5:16.","refs":[["Ps",34,15,34,15],["Jas",5,16,5,16]]},{"text":"Are poor and needy. — Isa 41:17.","refs":[["Isa",41,17,41,17]]},{"text":"Are assured of. — 1Jo 5:15.","refs":[["1John",5,15,5,15]]},{"text":"Love God for. — Ps 116:1.","refs":[["Ps",116,1,116,1]]},{"text":"Bless God for. — Ps 66:20.","refs":[["Ps",66,20,66,20]]},{"text":"Praise God for. — Ps 116:17; 118:21.","refs":[["Ps",116,17,116,17],["Ps",118,21,118,21]]},{"text":"A motive for continued prayer — Ps 116:2.","refs":[["Ps",116,2,116,2]]},{"text":"Ask amiss. — Jas 4:3.","refs":[["Jas",4,3,4,3]]},{"text":"Regard iniquity in the heart. — Ps 66:18.","refs":[["Ps",66,18,66,18]]},{"text":"Live in sin. — Isa 59:2; Joh 9:31.","refs":[["Isa",59,2,59,2],["John",9,31,9,31]]},{"text":"Offer unworthy service to God. — Mal 1:7-9.","refs":[["Mal",1,7,1,9]]},{"text":"Forsake God. — Jer 14:10,12.","refs":[["Jer",14,10,14,10],["Jer",14,12,14,12]]},{"text":"Reject the call of God. — Pr 1:24,25,28.","refs":[["Prov",1,24,1,24],["Prov",1,25,1,25],["Prov",1,28,1,28]]},{"text":"Hear not the law. — Pr 28:9; Zec 7:11-13.","refs":[["Prov",28,9,28,9],["Zech",7,11,7,13]]},{"text":"Are deaf to the cry of the poor. — Pr 21:13.","refs":[["Prov",21,13,21,13]]},{"text":"Are blood shedders. — Isa 1:15; 59:3.","refs":[["Isa",1,15,1,15],["Isa",59,3,59,3]]},{"text":"Are idolaters. — Jer 11:11-14; Eze 8:15-18.","refs":[["Jer",11,11,11,14],["Ezek",8,15,8,18]]},{"text":"Are wavering. — Jas 1:6,7.","refs":[["Jas",1,6,1,6],["Jas",1,7,1,7]]},{"text":"Are hypocrites. — Job 27:8,9.","refs":[["Job",27,8,27,8],["Job",27,9,27,9]]},{"text":"Are proud. — Job 35:12,13.","refs":[["Job",35,12,35,12],["Job",35,13,35,13]]},{"text":"Are self-righteous. — Lu 18:11,12,14.","refs":[["Luke",18,11,18,11],["Luke",18,12,18,12],["Luke",18,14,18,14]]},{"text":"Are the enemies of saints. — Ps 18:40,41.","refs":[["Ps",18,40,18,40],["Ps",18,41,18,41]]},{"text":"Cruelly oppress saints. — Mic 3:2-4.","refs":[["Mic",3,2,3,4]]},{"text":"Abraham. — Ge 17:20.","refs":[["Gen",17,20,17,20]]},{"text":"Lot. — Ge 19:19-21.","refs":[["Gen",19,19,19,21]]},{"text":"Abraham’s servant. — Ge 24:15-27.","refs":[["Gen",24,15,24,27]]},{"text":"Jacob. — Ge 32:24-30.","refs":[["Gen",32,24,32,30]]},{"text":"Israelites. — Ex 2:23,24.","refs":[["Exod",2,23,2,23],["Exod",2,24,2,24]]},{"text":"Moses. — Ex 17:4-6,11-13; 32:11-14.","refs":[["Exod",17,4,17,6],["Exod",17,11,17,13],["Exod",32,11,32,14]]},{"text":"Samson. — Jdj 15:18,19.","refs":[["Judg",15,18,15,18],["Judg",15,19,15,19]]},{"text":"Hannah. — 1Sa 1:27.","refs":[["1Sam",1,27,1,27]]},{"text":"Samuel. — 1Sa 7:9.","refs":[["1Sam",7,9,7,9]]},{"text":"Solomon. — 1Ki 3:9,12.","refs":[["1Kgs",3,9,3,9],["1Kgs",3,12,3,12]]},{"text":"Man of God. — 1Ki 13:6.","refs":[["1Kgs",13,6,13,6]]},{"text":"Elijah. — 1Ki 18:36-38; Jas 5:17,18.","refs":[["1Kgs",18,36,18,38],["Jas",5,17,5,17],["Jas",5,18,5,18]]},{"text":"Elisha. — 2Ki 4:33-35.","refs":[["2Kgs",4,33,4,35]]},{"text":"Jehoahaz. — 2Ki 13:4.","refs":[["2Kgs",13,4,13,4]]},{"text":"Hezekiah. — 2Ki 19:20.","refs":[["2Kgs",19,20,19,20]]},{"text":"Jabez. — 1Ch 4:10.","refs":[["1Chr",4,10,4,10]]},{"text":"Asa. — 2Ch 14:11,12.","refs":[["2Chr",14,11,14,11],["2Chr",14,12,14,12]]},{"text":"Jehoshaphat. — 2Ch 20:6-17.","refs":[["2Chr",20,6,20,17]]},{"text":"Manasseh. — 2Ch 33:13,19.","refs":[["2Chr",33,13,33,13],["2Chr",33,19,33,19]]},{"text":"Ezra. — Ezr 8:21-23.","refs":[["Ezra",8,21,8,23]]},{"text":"Nehemiah. — Ne